  "generated_text": "1. **Calculate the product of $a$, $b$, $c$, and $d$:**\n   \\[\n   \\begin{aligned}\n   a &= \\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{6}, \\\\\n   b &= -\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{6}, \\\\\n   c &= \\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{6}, \\\\\n   d &= -\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{6}.\n   \\end{aligned}\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   abc &= (\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{6})(-\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{6})(\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{6})(-\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{6})\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   = (\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{6})(-\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{6})(\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{6})(-\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{6})\n   \\]\n   \\",
